MetricFlow cannot divide two metrics or round inside a query, and this layer has no average metric. So this query returns the two parts of the average in one row: total exploded parts (`catalog_parts`) and the number of sets (`set_attr`). The answer is `catalog_parts / set_attr`, rounded to 2 decimals.

